OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CChief medical officer Gregor Smith     
OL,5,Cresigns on mental health grounds       
OL,6,GScotland's chief medical officer, Sir  
OL,7,GGregor Smith, has resigned on mental   
OL,8,Ghealth grounds.                        
OL,10,FThe 55-year-old, who has served in the 
OL,11,Fposition since December 2020, has      
OL,12,Ffaced questions over his role in the   
OL,13,Fhandling of avoidable deaths at NHS    
OL,14,FGrampian in recent weeks.              
OL,16,FSmith said in a statement that he did  
OL,17,Fnot "currently enjoy the good mental   
OL,18,Fhealth necessary" to continue in the   
OL,19,Fjob, adding that guiding the country   
OL,20,Fthrough the Covid pandemic and its     
OL,21,Faftermath had "taken its toll".        
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
