OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CFour police officers suspended in      
OL,5,Cinquiry into 'on-duty conduct'         
OL,6,GFour police officers in the north-east 
OL,7,Gof Scotland have been suspended amid   
OL,8,Ginquiries into their "on-duty conduct".
OL,10,FBBC Scotland News understands two jury 
OL,11,Fcases have been deserted because of    
OL,12,Fthe suspensions. The Crown Office and  
OL,13,FProcurator Fiscal Service (COPFS)      
OL,14,Fcould bring the cases back to court in 
OL,15,Fthe future.                            
OL,17,FInquiries by Police Scotland's         
OL,18,FProfessional Standards Department      
OL,19,F(PSD) are ongoing.                     
OL,21,FThe reasons for the suspensions have   
OL,22,Fnot been given.                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
