OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CPrincess of Wales drops in on arts     
OL,5,Cproject in the Borders                 
OL,6,GThe Princess of Wales has been in the  
OL,7,GScottish Borders to see the work of an 
OL,8,Garts organisation that is helping to   
OL,9,Gsupport projects across the UK.        
OL,11,FIt was her first engagement since two  
OL,12,Fmen were charged with trying to steal  
OL,13,Fcufflinks and a clock from the royal   
OL,14,Fcouple's country home in Norfolk.      
OL,16,FThe Hugo Burge Foundation (HBF) which  
OL,17,Fhas three bases in the region - one of 
OL,18,Fthem on the Marchmont Estate near Duns 
OL,19,F- carries the name of the internet     
OL,20,Fentrepreneur and philanthropist who    
OL,21,Fdied in 2023 aged 51.                  
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
