OL,4,CWoman who killed aunt to remain in     
OL,5,Cpsychiatric hospital for treatment     
OL,6,GA woman who killed her elderly aunt is 
OL,7,Gto remain in hospital.                 
OL,9,FLouise Markson, 52, fatally attacked   
OL,10,FSusan Sergison at her home in          
OL,11,FHamilton, South Lanarkshire, in        
OL,12,FJanuary 2025.                          
OL,14,FShe is alleged to have struck her aunt 
OL,15,Fwith blunt and sharp-edged implements, 
OL,16,Fa mug and a pen while also stamping on 
OL,17,Fher and kicking her.                   
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
